        quips={
            dq_1={
                "Yikes! I hope you",
                "have a few tricks",
                "up your sleeve for",
                "this final challenge!",
            },
            lq_1={
                "Maybe Go Fish",
                "is more our",
                "speed...",
            },
            lq_10={
                "What a flop!",
            },
            lq_2={
                "We folded like",
                "a cheap suit!",
            },
            lq_3={
                "Time for us",
                "to shuffle off",
                "and try again!",
            },
            lq_4={
                "You know what",
                "they say, the",
                "house always wins!",
